  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.9.72",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.9.72\n\nReleased on 2026-11-20.\n\nRenders limited by a CPU quota, such as a Kubernetes CPU limit, get their workers back, so long renders run at full speed again. Sealed previews restack layers from the layers panel and the timeline, and their videos keep colour grading and audio effects.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Engine:** Renders under a CPU quota get their workers back ([db5950c00](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/db5950c0049cd38b4fa73712121556c763621211), [#8262](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8262)).\n- **Studio:** Dragging a layer in a sealed preview's layers panel restacks it ([9c3bfe150](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/9c3bfe150eada7728d1d99f4b957aeba863cb081), [#8209](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8209)).\n- **Core:** A sealed preview's own videos load with CORS, so colour grading and audio effects work ([7b3eda190](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/7b3eda1908e4c69d2bbbbb59cffaa3acdd740ac1), [#8189](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8189)).\n- **CLI:** Describe the sign-in return test in plain words ([c28cda322](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c28cda322b5046f11215344b4ad8db8eae132391), [#8259](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8259)).\n- **Media Use:** Escape audio engine summary and broken audio_meta.json errors ([4a11e46c7](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4a11e46c708c552a4419be96f4d544b80112a706), [#8258](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8258)).\n- **Studio:** Save the stacking reorder of a timeline drag in a sealed preview ([9dd8be3ac](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/9dd8be3ac41af6b1958c76cabdbbd5ef53f6869c), [#8167](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8167)).\n\n## Docs & Examples\n\n- **Skills:** Give the 9:16 safe band that `check` enforces ([bcb2dd031](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/bcb2dd031c1dc922807760a4f9eb5f627432003f), [#8261](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8261)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.9.71...v0.9.72\n"
}
